  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Entrepreneurship and Skills Development Program to support the National Economic and Social Development Program PDES 2026-2031</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Preparatory Assistance (PA) is being requested in response to the request made to UNIDO Bolivia to support the new Governments initiatives in the sector of Entrepreneurship and Skills development.  The PA would finance two components:  Component 1: Formulation of a Project Document in response to the current ongoing initiatives being taken by the new government in c ooperation with the multilateral and bilateral agencies in Bolivia.  Component 2: Mobilize committed partnerships and funds for the project document from Bolivian national government and main cooperation agencies  The PA strategy is to assess and define TA-related areas for the implementation of a National Entrepreneurship and Skills Development Program with the National Authorities and Private Sector. Furthermore, the PA will include specific initiatives to mobilize and secure the required partnerships and funding.</narrative>
  </description>
